<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK FEB DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 320 BLN.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK FEB DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 320 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland said on</p>
<p>Friday the required daily money market liquidity balance for the</p>
<p>rest of the month was 320 billion markka.</p>
<p>The central bank gave the following figures (FIM mln):</p>
<p> Liquidity estimate for March 4		    41,000</p>
<p> Minimum reserve requirement for March	    6,327</p>
<p> Average reserves to Feb 27			   7,567</p>
<p> Required daily balance for remaining period    320</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, news@Reuters.fi</p>
</text>
